          "message": {
            "text": "Scroll ownership and capture ownership are deliberately separate. An inner element can receive scrollTop updates while the capture root and page-space crop exclude surrounding fixed chrome; every anchor still executes the normal live capture pipeline, which also preserves virtualized rows regenerated after the scroll event.",
            "markdown": "Scroll ownership and capture ownership are deliberately separate. An inner element can receive scrollTop updates while the capture root and page-space crop exclude surrounding fixed chrome; every anchor still executes the normal live capture pipeline, which also preserves virtualized rows regenerated after the scroll event."
          },
