            "text": "An unchanged pause needs its own same-offset timeline endpoint; extending the prior capture would incorrectly stretch the motion that arrived there. Marking the fresh authenticated capture timeline-only preserves the exact pause duration and final output period while avoiding a second paint subtree for identical DOM.",
